<title>FRANCE: EU grain export/import balance.</title>
<headline>EU grain export/import balance.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union committed 1.319 million  tonnes of soft wheat for export in roughly the first month of the  new July/June campaign, official figures showed on Friday.</p>
<p>Export licence awards for July 1 to July 29 included 162,000 tonnes  of soft wheat grain and soft wheat flour exports of 1.148 million  tonnes in grain equivalent.</p>
<p>There was also 9,000 tonnes of food aid.</p>
<p>Grain traders have said about 750,000 tonnes of flour were booked  for export between last Friday and Tuesday of this week at a refund  of one Ecu per tonne.</p>
<p>The refund was scrapped on Thursday.</p>
<p>Wheat flour volumes are converted to their grain equivalent by using  a coefficient of 1.37.</p>
</text>
